Z||000001||Phil||06-01-2001||11:19 PM||||From what I've gathered from the Forum the stock computer is fine but you may need an adjustable fuel pressure regulater. On the headers- just porting your stock ones will gain you just about the same increase as headers, and the porting is almost free.||||reg||1
