Z||000003||88formula||06-03-2001||03:31 PM||||FOCOA headers are the best I have ever seen. They look like this  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FOCOA_headers.jpg">  and this  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headers.JPG">  . I ordered a set for my 3.4-liter engine. They cost $550 un-coated and $740 coated for the three piece set you see in the picture. If I were you I would get them coated. <P>You can get then from Gloria Huff @ 714-635-0898. Your other option is to get the sprint manifolds from the fierostore but they are not headers. You can find them in the vendor’s section of the forum. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
